<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>重庆旅游攻略</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', SimHei, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f7f7;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .container {
            width: 800px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #fef5e6;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #000;
        }
        .header h1 .red-text {
            color: #d81e06;
            font-size: 36px;
        }
        .header .subtitle {
            color: #e27329;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            table-layout: fixed;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 12px;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #7b6357;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .col-time { width: 10%; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: middle;}
        .col-route { width: 85%; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px;}
        .col-eat { width: 5%; }

        .day-label {
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* Day 4 special column styling */
        .day4-time-col {
            vertical-align: top;
            padding-top: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .red-blob {
            background-color: #d1121a;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%;
            padding: 25px 8px;
            display: inline-block;
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .dots {
            color: #d1121a;
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .vertical-text {
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        /* Day 4 details styling */
        .details-block {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .check-box {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #009944;
            color: #fff;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            line-height: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-size: 12px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            margin-right: 4px;
        }
        .green-title {
            color: #009944;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .time-row {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .time-row .red-time {
            color: #d1121a;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .normal-text {
            color: #444;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .bold-point {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .orange-point {
            color: #d37315;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>去过<span class="red-text">6次重庆</span> 深度解锁千里江山</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">3D魔幻网红打卡+小众人文建筑+地道小吃</p>
    </div>

    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th class="col-time">时间</th>
                <th class="col-route">线路</th>
                <th class="col-eat">吃</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td class="col-time"><span class="day-label">第1天</span></td>
                <td class="col-route">
                    🌟三峡博物馆 (重庆大礼堂) →解放碑→八一好吃街→能仁寺→左营天桥<br>→🌟罗汉寺·摩崖石刻→朝天门→🏙️来福士/WFC观景台 (2选1) →魁星<br>楼→🏞️洪崖洞·夜景→❤️千厮门大桥
                </td>
                <td class="col-eat"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="col-time"><span class="day-label">第2天</span></td>
                <td class="col-route">
                    马鞍山堂里→🌟中山四路文化街区→地铁/打车 🌟鹅岭公园→鹅岭二厂→李<br>子坝→地铁观音桥→北仓文创园→🏞️不夜九街
                </td>
                <td class="col-eat"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="col-time"><span class="day-label">第3天</span></td>
                <td class="col-route">
                    🌟山城第三步道→十八梯→白象居→湖广会馆→东水门城墙→过江长江索<br>道/两江怀旧游轮 (2选1) →龙门浩老街→弹子石老街→南滨游艇广场→<br>南滨路→🏞️南山一棵树·夜景
                </td>
                <td class="col-eat"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="day4-time-col">
                    <div class="red-blob">第4天</div>
                    <div class="dots">⋮</div>
                    <div class="vertical-text">可根据情况替换！</div>
                </td>
                <td class="col-route">
                    🌟渣滓洞白公馆→磁器口古镇→打车马房湾七彩巷→罗中立美术馆→🌟黄<br>桷坪涂鸦一条街→交通茶馆→铁路四村

                    <div class="details-block">
                        <div><span class="check-box">✔</span> <span class="green-title">渣滓洞白公馆景区</span></div>
                        <div class="time-row">⏰ <span class="red-time">9:00-16:30</span> 网上实名制预约</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">烈士墓、渣滓洞、白公馆往返专线客车，每人20元</div>

                        <div class="bold-point">▶渣滓洞</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">原为人工开采小煤窑，1920年由资本家程尔昌所建，后煤窑被军统所霸占改造成监狱。</div>

                        <div class="bold-point">▶白公馆</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">原为四川军阀白驹郊外别墅，白驹自诩是白居易的后台，<br>1939年军统特务头子戴笠，改造为迫害革命家的监狱。</div>

                        <div class="orange-point">▶磁器口古镇</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">商业化严重，但是可以一看<br>重庆非常有名的古镇，感受这座城市历史和古韵，还有各种各样的小吃，</div>

                        <div class="orange-point">▶马房湾七彩巷（网红打卡）</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">童话世界中的彩色王国，房子都被涂成了五颜六色，明星涂鸦墙</div>

                        <div><span class="check-box">✔</span> <span class="green-title">罗中立美术馆</span></div>
                        <div class="time-row">⏰ <span class="red-time">9:30-16:30</span> （周一闭馆）免费 微信“四川美院美术馆”预约</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">川美黄桷坪校区，面积最大的美术馆，旁边是大学城有名熙街</div>

                        <div><span class="check-box">✔</span> <span class="green-title">黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</span></div>
                        <div class="normal-text">川美黄桷坪校区，这条街上从楼房、墙面，到校园、店铺等满满的涂鸦</div>

                        <div class="bold-point">▶交通茶馆</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">一杯茶10元 黄桷坪正街4号</div>
                        <div class="normal-text" style="text-align: center;">始于1987年，保持上世纪七八十年代风格，水泥地面、红砖柱头，四方桌、条凳，青<br>花茶碗...喝茶嗑瓜子打麻将摆龙门阵。电影《疯狂的石头》取景</div>

                        <div class="bold-point">▶铁路四村</div>
                        <div class="normal-text">废弃的铁轨上长满了绿色植物，瞬间掉入宫崎骏动画的感觉<br>有一家军哥书屋的二手书店。</div>
                    </div>
                </td>
                <td class="col-eat"></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
